Picture black rock spire, upper or lower. Or maraudon. Or other.

Playerbots lead a team through the dungeon, Fighting monsters and clearing rooms. You, the player, set up camps behind them in the rooms you clear with supplies and fresh soldiers for the frontlines. You are beset on all sides, but if you can maintain a presence in all prior rooms, the boss ahead will fall, as they are not supported. Sometimes they fall back.